# Lacunosa Town (a town that goes in at dusk and keeps the old stories): a slow clarinet tune in D minor over a hushed choir, a
# harp arpeggio like a clock that never hurries, and a low string line. It plays the same by day and by night. Original
# composition for this game (plan 22 · U7, part b).
